    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Vicente</i>, a night guard that works in Corcovado, taking care of this brazilian tourist spot, christ the redeemer. Your co-worker called you, saying someone is walking around the statue, and you quickly make your way there, uncovering terrifying truths.<br><br>A <strong>First Person</strong>, <strong>Singleplayer</strong>, <strong>Walk-Simulator, Realistic Graphics, Simple and Quick Gameplay(WASD and E for interacting), Small 2 Person Team Indie Game\u00a0</strong>experience. Investigate what is happening and try to escape this nightmare.<br><br>Corcovado's Night Guard is a first person survival horror game with a linear narrative, run and explore this place being careful to not get attacked in the process. Complete the objetives to stay alive. it's a short game, made to be finished in a single sitting, with 2 main levels, the second one being reached after playing through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635850/extras/310c88c2ee5f0f90109f04e3172b7f1b.avif?t=1746214162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk Around Corcovado</strong>: Explore this place based on the real Corcovado, the local where Christ the Redeemer lives, follow the clues to uncover what's behind your coworker's disappearance. <br> <br><strong>Uncover The Mystery</strong>: You will find notes, they will give you an idea of what is after your and maybe why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Something is after you, run, hiding won't help you all the time, they are toying with you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Vicente</i>, a night guard that works in Corcovado, taking care of this brazilian tourist spot, christ the redeemer. Your co-worker called you, saying someone is walking around the statue, and you quickly make your way there, uncovering terrifying truths.<br><br>A <strong>First Person</strong>, <strong>Singleplayer</strong>, <strong>Walk-Simulator, Realistic Graphics, Simple and Quick Gameplay(WASD and E for interacting), Small 2 Person Team Indie Game\u00a0</strong>experience. Investigate what is happening and try to escape this nightmare.<br><br>Corcovado's Night Guard is a first person survival horror game with a linear narrative, run and explore this place being careful to not get attacked in the process. Complete the objetives to stay alive. it's a short game, made to be finished in a single sitting, with 2 main levels, the second one being reached after playing through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635850/extras/310c88c2ee5f0f90109f04e3172b7f1b.avif?t=1746214162\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk Around Corcovado</strong>: Explore this place based on the real Corcovado, the local where Christ the Redeemer lives, follow the clues to uncover what's behind your coworker's disappearance. <br> <br><strong>Uncover The Mystery</strong>: You will find notes, they will give you an idea of what is after your and maybe why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Something is after you, run, hiding won't help you all the time, they are toying with you.</p>",
